It used to be. Now it's literally two lines:

```css
display: flex;
place-items: center;
```

Or grid:
```css
display: grid;
place-items: center;
```

The memes are outdated. Flexbox solved this years ago.

`useEffect` buat side effects — hal-hal yang terjadi di luar render cycle, kayak fetch data, subscribe event, atau manipulasi DOM.

```jsx
useEffect(() => {
  fetchData();
}, [dependency]);
```

Dependency array kosong `[]` = jalan sekali pas mount. Ada dependency = jalan tiap kali dependency itu berubah.

It's syntactic sugar over Promises. When you `await` something, you're pausing execution of that function until the Promise resolves, without blocking the main thread.

```js
// This:
const data = await fetch(url).then(r => r.json());

// Is essentially this:
fetch(url)
  .then(r => r.json())
  .then(data => { ... });
```

Async/await is just cleaner to read and easier to handle errors with try/catch.

Mobile-first CSS + flexbox/grid.

```css
/* Mobile default */
.container {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

/* Desktop */
@media (min-width: 768px) {
  .container {
    flex-direction: row;
  }
}
```

Hindari hardcode pixel width. Pake `%`, `vw`, `rem`, atau `clamp()` buat sizing yang flexible.

Pake CSS custom properties dan media query.

```css
:root {
  --bg: white;
  --text: black;
}

@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root {
    --bg: #121212;
    --text: white;
  }
}

body {
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
}
```

Kalo mau toggle manual, tambahin class ke `<html>` dan switch via JS.

Pake animasi gradient yang gerak.

```css
.skeleton {
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #e0e0e0 25%, #f0f0f0 50%, #e0e0e0 75%);
  background-size: 200% 100%;
  animation: shimmer 1.5s infinite;
}

@keyframes shimmer {
  0% { background-position: -200% 0; }
  100% { background-position: 200% 0; }
}
```

Tampilin ini di tempat konten yang lagi di-load.

Pake Intersection Observer API — jauh lebih efisien dari scroll event listener.

```js
const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
  if (entries[0].isIntersecting) {
    loadMoreData();
  }
});

observer.observe(document.querySelector('#sentinel'));
```

Taruh elemen `#sentinel` di bawah list. Pas dia masuk viewport, load data berikutnya.

Grid emang powerful. Bisa define rows dan columns sekaligus, items bisa span multiple cells, dan ga perlu wrapper div yang bersarang-sarang kayak zaman flexbox.

```css
.layout {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-areas:
    'header header'
    'sidebar main'
    'footer footer';
}
```

Itu udah cukup buat bikin layout kompleks tanpa wrapper hell.
